sequenceDiagram
    participant AC as Agent Core
    participant SG as Scope Guard
    participant TR as Tool Runner
    participant VER as Verifier
    participant HU as Human Reviewer
    participant DB as Finding Store

    AC->>AC: Suspects finding (e.g. SQL injection)
    AC->>DB: Create finding (status: SUSPECTED)
    AC->>DB: Attach evidence (raw output, request/response, timestamps)

    AC->>VER: Submit claim + evidence bundle
    Note over VER: Verifier runs in isolated context.<br/>Sees only the claim and evidence.<br/>Cannot access Agent Core conversation.

    VER->>SG: Request reproduction action
    SG->>SG: Validate action against scope
    SG-->>VER: Action approved

    VER->>TR: Execute reproduction (different path)
    TR-->>VER: Tool output

    alt Finding reproduced
        VER->>DB: Update status: CONFIRMED
        VER->>DB: Attach independent evidence + confidence score
        VER->>AC: Verification result: CONFIRMED
    else Finding not reproduced
        VER->>DB: Update status: NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW
        VER->>DB: Attach reproduction attempt details
        VER->>HU: Flag for human review
        HU->>DB: Update status: CONFIRMED or REJECTED
        HU-->>AC: Human decision
    else Verifier determines false positive
        VER->>DB: Update status: REJECTED
        VER->>DB: Attach rejection reasoning
        VER->>AC: Verification result: REJECTED
    end

    AC->>AC: Update engagement state and continue
